     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"DE\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear listers. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I have another issue in fitting my models. For model VVI, I get “NAs” for &gt; 5 profiles. I added function priorControl() to fix this and it worked. But now I am unsure about the results as BIC has a huge bump indicating\r\n better model fit while the model could not be estimated before. Do you have any thoughts on how to deal with that? You can see the differences here:\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"># BIC without priorControl<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">1 -127005.8<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">2 -121027.1<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">3 -119558.0<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">4 -118765.7<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">5 -118293.6<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">6  NA<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">7  NA<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">8  NA<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">9  NA<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"># BIC with priorControl<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">1 -127006.0<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">2 -121028.2<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">3 -119560.0<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">4 -118771.7<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">5 -118296.9<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">6 -112761.8<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">7 -112579.7<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">8 -112353.3<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">9 -112460.2<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>______________________________________________<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:#44546a\">Jennifer Schauer, M.A.\r\n<u></u><u></u>